<title>HONG KONG: Deutsche Bank sets warrants on SHK Prop.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sets warrants on SHK Prop.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG, London Branch, said on Wednesday it priced 98 million American-style warrants on shares of Sun Hung Kai Properties Ltd.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$95	  PREMIUM	   15 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$1.425     GEARING	   6.7X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  15.JAN.98    MIN EXER LOT    10,000</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG    BOARD LOT	 10,000</p>
<p> PAYDATE	     31.JAN.97    LISTING DATE    5.FEB.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$95	  GOVERNING LAW   HONG KONG</p>
<p> NOTE		  PHYSICAL DELIVERY</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
